msgstr "Penyetelan gerak"

#: ../../library/omv.apds9960.rst:428
msgid ""
"Minimum sample magnitude (per photodiode) used by the gesture decoder when "
"searching for the first/last in-range FIFO samples."
msgstr ""
"Magnitudo sampel minimum (per photodiode) yang digunakan oleh decoder gerak "
"saat mencari sampel FIFO pertama/terakhir dalam rentang."

